  },
  {
   "id": 38,
   "kind": "heading",
   "start": 8808,
   "end": 8843,
   "text": "### Evaluate in your hardware setup",
   "tokens": []
  },
  {
   "id": 39,
   "kind": "para",
   "start": 8845,
   "end": 9038,
   "text": "Once you have trained your model using your parameters you can run inference in your downstream task. Follow the instructions in [Policy Deployment (lerobot-rollout)](⟦0⟧). For example:",
   "tokens": [
    "./inference"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": 40,
   "kind": "quote",
   "start": 10176,
   "end": 10272,
   "text": "> [!NOTE]\n> Value of ⟦0⟧ should not exceed 5 to ensure stable inference.",
   "tokens": [
    "`inference.queue_threshold`"
   ]
  },
